title: "HackMatch — US-028: ADMIN Audit Review Sequence"
---
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"background":"#ffffff","primaryColor":"#e8f1ff","primaryTextColor":"#1f2937","primaryBorderColor":"#3b82f6","lineColor":"#4b5563","secondaryColor":"#f1e8ff","tertiaryColor":"#fff7d6","fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif"},"sequence":{"useMaxWidth":true,"diagramMarginX":25,"diagramMarginY":18,"actorMargin":34,"width":165,"height":60,"boxMargin":8,"messageMargin":24,"noteMargin":10}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Active ADMIN
    participant UI as AuditRecordsPage
    participant API as Audit records API
    participant Guard as ADMIN guard and validator
    participant Service as Audit records service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL query RPC

    Admin->>UI: Open audit review
    UI->>API: GET /api/admin/audit-records
    API->>Guard: Verify Firebase, MFA, active ADMIN
    Guard->>Guard: Validate actor, action, category, dates, cursor
    Guard->>Service: Request filtered page
    Service->>DB: query_admin_audit_records
    DB->>DB: Re-verify non-suspended ADMIN
    DB->>DB: Filter and keyset-page one snapshot
    DB-->>Service: Records, hasMore, nextCursor
    Service->>Service: Apply explicit safe projection and scrubbing
    Service-->>API: No-store audit page
    API-->>UI: Safe records and normalized filters
    UI-->>Admin: Loading, rows, empty, or next-page state

    opt Change filters or refresh
        Admin->>UI: Apply filters or refresh newest
        UI->>API: GET with normalized query
        API->>Guard: Re-authorize and validate query
        Guard->>Service: Request next safe page
        Service->>DB: Read next snapshot
        DB-->>Service: Matching page
        Service-->>UI: Scrubbed records and cursor
    end

    alt Visitor, PART, or invalid request
        Guard-->>API: Safe denied or validation error
        API-->>UI: No audit records
        UI-->>Admin: Access or retry state
    end

    Note over UI,DB: The interface is read-only.<br/>No update, delete, or truncate path is exposed.

